 expand your storage space and unlock new ways to interact with the procedural maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rogue Like Extraction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you die in Drift Scavenger you lose everything you bring in and everything you have collected during the current run, Except for a special limited space inventory that allows you to keep a couple items.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to beat the game you must defeat all bosses in one run. The more time you spend in a singular run the harder it gets as the hatred in the underworld grows so you need to make sure you bring the right items in and use them at the right times for one final perfect run. </p>","developers":["Evil Villain Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557470/c5ab2137fbf6acf6ef58e2763fdf31599084c11d/header.jpg?t=1761261263","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2557470/1150907623/9550381d00d76132a87f99e3c5df0f17870f1edd/1761250302/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761253299","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2557470/1150907623/9550381d00d76132a87f99e3c5df0f17870f1edd/1761250302/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761253299","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2557470/1150907623/9550381d00d76132a87f99e3c5df0f17870f1edd/1761250302/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761253299","id":256970257,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256970257/movie480.mp4?t=1761253299","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256970257/movie_max.mp4?t=1761253299"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256970257/23f21a31a80cde994842604c18d9d89b809c3f7b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761253299","webm"